        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: VIVmag, La Belle Assemblée\n- People: David Harrison Gilmour, John Bell\n- Companies: FIJI Water LLC, Zinio Systems, Inc.\n- Topics: magazine launches, publication history\n\nFacts:\n- La Belle Assemblée was a British women's magazine founded by John Bell and published from 1806 to 1837.\n- VIVmag was launched in 2006.\n- VIVmag was backed by Canadian industrialist David Harrison Gilmour, who founded FIJI Water LLC.\n- The first issue of VIVmag appeared in January-February 2007.\n- VIVmag was distributed by Zinio Systems, Inc.",
